claim_1.claim_text:
A method of creating a hydrogel coating with improved mechanical strength and resistance to polymer chain scission, the method comprising:
a) providing a hydrogel matrix;
b) providing nanofibers;
c) covalently bonding the nanofibers to the hydrogel matrix through a click reaction to create a covalent bond between the nanofibers and the hydrogel matrix, wherein the covalent bond enhances the mechanical strength of the hydrogel matrix and reduces the impact of polymer chain scission.
